# Ghana Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Ghana's governance ecosystem.

The objective is to illustrate how governance, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), public finance, institutional memory, coordination, and AI governance reinforce one another to create long-term institutional capability.

This document is an illustrative reference architecture.

---

# National Context

Country: Republic of Ghana

Population: ~35 million

Government System: Presidential Constitutional Republic

Administrative Structure

- Central Government
- 16 Regions
- Metropolitan, Municipal and District Assemblies (MMDAs)

